      "name": "Bare",
      "summary": "No freckles, no birthmark.",
      "description": "The details component appears on one avatar in ten. Off, every avatar is built the same way. Worth knowing for the rest of these: what this style calls the background is the face, so `backgroundColor` sets the complexion and the tile at once.",
